"description":"Halo helps you stay focused by turning places into focus zones. When you're in a zone like your desk, library, or bedroom, distracting apps are automatically limited. No willpower required. Just set it and forget it.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\n• FOCUS ZONES: Draw zones on a map (home, office, café, campus) and set when they’re active. Focus mode turns on when you’re there.\n\n• APP BLOCKING: Block social media, video, games, and other distracting apps—only in your zones. Uses Apple Screen Time, so you stay in control.\n\n• SCREEN TIME GOALS: Set daily limits and see how you’re doing. Your Halo level reflects your progress.\n\n• STREAKS: Build streaks with daily check-ins. Stay consistent and grow your streak over time.\n\nSTUDY • DEEP WORK • SLEEP\n\nUse presets for Study, Deep Work, or Sleep—or create custom zones with your own rules.\n\nPERFECT FOR\n\n• Students studying at the library or at home\n• Workers doing deep work at the office\n• Anyone who wants healthier screen habits\n• People who struggle with phone distractions\n\nDark theme. Simple setup. Your data stays on your device.\n\nPremium subscription required to unlock zone-based blocking, unlimited focus zones, screen time stats, focus streaks, and background enforcement. Free trial available; subscriptions auto-renew until cancelled and can be managed in your Apple ID settings. \n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/", "minimumOsVersion":"16.0", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"39307264", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":15, "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":5, "trackCensoredName":"Halo: Location-Based Focus", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/halo-location-based-focus/id6756292368?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":5, "genres":["Productivity"], "userRatingCount":15}, 
