"description":"【Pomo Focus】 is a calm focus timer that turns every work cycle into a gentle rhythm — quiet reminders, immersive soundscapes, and clear insights help you stay present without pressure.\n\n**Rhythmic Focus Modes**\n\nChoose Pomodoro, Meeting, or Breathing to fit the moment. Each mode runs on a wall-clock timer that stays accurate even after the app moves to the background, with optional Progressive Pomodoro for slowly stretching your sessions.\n\n**Immersive Soundscapes**\n\nBlend rain, birdsong, white noise, and office chatter with Soft, Heavy, or Storm variants. Save your favorite mix and bring it back instantly the next day.\n\n**Flow Insights**\n\nReview your daily flow score, current streak, four-week habit calendar, and optimal focus window. Every chart updates from your real local sessions, never from prefilled samples.\n\n**Journey & Milestones**\n\nEarn XP for every completed session, climb through level titles such as Flow Walker and Zen Master, and collect milestones that reflect your real practice — seven-day streaks, deep work hours, breathing rituals, and more.\n\n**Health & Reminders**\n\nCompleted breathing sessions can be saved to Apple Health's Mindful Minutes after you grant permission. Local notifications quietly remind you when a session ends, so you can switch attention without watching the screen.\n\nPomo Focus keeps your attention soft and steady. Open it whenever you want a kinder pace for work, study, or rest.\n\nIf you'd like to access more features, you can choose to upgrade to a premium account.\n\nPremium account pricing and terms\n\n$4.99/week*\n\n$39.99/year*\n\n*Prices shown are in USD; actual charges may be converted to your local currency based on your country/region.\n\nPayment will be charged to your iTunes account at confirmation of purchase.\n\nSubscriptions automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\n\nThe account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period, and the renewal cost will be provided. Subscriptions may be managed by the user. To turn off auto-renewal, go to the user's account settings after purchase.\n\nDuring an active subscription, cancellation of the current subscription is not allowed.\n\nAny unused portion of a free trial period (if offered) will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication.\n\nEULA: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://busecaner.xyz/fanjiazhuanzhu/privacy.html", "minimumOsVersion":"16.0", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "ZH"], "fileSizeBytes":"2961408", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":0, "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":0, "sellerUrl":"https://busecaner.xyz/fanjiazhuanzhu/support.html", "trackCensoredName":"Pomo Focus - Focus Timer .", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/pomo-focus-focus-timer/id6764045180?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":0, "genres":["Productivity"], "userRatingCount":0}, 
