"description":"Improved mood. Better sleep. Sharper focus. Clinically tested.\n\nHalo is a wellness device and companion app that uses transcranial direct current stimulation (tDCS) to support mood, sleep, and focus. It delivers low-level electrical currents to the prefrontal cortex - an area of the brain linked to emotional regulation, sleep quality, and attention control.\n\nThe Halo app guides you through stimulation sessions, tracks your usage, and offers regular check ins and educational content to help reach your wellness goals.\n\nDeveloped by the team behind Flow Neuroscience, a leader in clinical brain stimulation. Halo is built on Flow’s proven brain stimulation platform - technology that’s supported thousands of people in Europe.\n\nWhat Halo helps with:\n\n* Improving your mood\n* Better sleep so you wake feeling more refreshed\n* Enhance your focus so you perform better at work and day to day\n* Building better routines that align with your goals\n\nHow does Halo work?\n\nHalo is a brain stimulation wearable that uses transcranial direct current stimulation (tDCS).\n\nIt delivers gentle, low-intensity electrical currents to the prefrontal cortex, a region of the brain involved in cognitive and emotional processes.\n\nWho it's for:\n* Wellness-focused individuals seeking safe, natural tools\n* Anyone looking to improve their mood, sleep or focus.\n* High-performers, creatives, and biohackers\n\nHalo is a general wellness product designed to support wellbeing. Halo is not approved or cleared by the FDA and is not intended, marketed, or sold to treat or cure any disease or condition. Halo is intended for use by healthy adult individuals. At this time, Halo is only available for shipment within the United States.", "minimumOsVersion":"15.0", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"184382464", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":2, "trackContentRating":"17+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":5, "sellerUrl":"https://haloneuroscience.com/", "trackCensoredName":"Halo - Brain Stimulation", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/halo-brain-stimulation/id6748301539?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"17+", "averageUserRating":5, "genres":["Health & Fitness", "Productivity"], "userRatingCount":2}]
